msgstr "Note"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/hyperv/hyperv.rst:151
msgid ""
"The working path, vm path, and disk path should be created on the Hyper-V"
" host by the Hyper-V administrator. If these paths are not created they "
"will need to be setup and the Hyper-V settings will need to adjusted to "
"reference them."
